{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"5bfb317c113d446df2664fbafd5c8d265111cbd6b13f4d3c6fba7f0a3becf15f"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:ca42264ae7a0c5411cd980ca6fe8cf850f84450f580f034c35b366a3ded0a70e","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"three","evidence":"[D3:12 | 4:15 pm on 20 April, 2023] Dave: Last weekend I went to a car show. Classic cars are so charming and the dedication people put into restoring them is amazing. That's why I'm so into auto engineering. Can't wait to show you some when you come to Boston! Oh, almost forgot to send a photo, look at this beautiful car!\n[D22:1 | 3:13 pm on 8 October, 2023] Dave: Hey Calvin! What’s up? Last Friday I went to the car show. I saw some awesome cars and got to mess with car mods! There were so many cool machines around, it was so much fun! Take a look at this beautiful car!","itemId":"urn:uuid:6919b840-a011-5efd-a806-6c86c38a219b","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:446f010280d698fb6b7f9472ac42ab122a2894f6514fbff865f345a60c8ec051","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How many car shows has Dave attended?","referenceAnswer":"two","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"446f010280d698fb6b7f9472ac42ab122a2894f6514fbff865f345a60c8ec051"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}